# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify static headers.
#
# Sets the COOP/COEP/CORP combination required for SharedArrayBuffer (which
# the @litert-lm/core and @mediapipe/tasks-genai WASM runtimes use for
# threading). With these set server-side, the bundled
# coi-serviceworker.js becomes a no-op fallback — kept for hosts that can't
# set custom headers (e.g. GitHub Pages).
#
# `*` matches every path under the Pages domain.

/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
